 "summary": "The 1N4448W is a single silicon epitaxial planar switching diode in the surface-mount SOD-123 case. It blocks 75 V continuous (100 V repetitive peak), carries 150 mA average forward current and recovers in 4 ns or less. Ordering codes ending -E3 are RoHS commercial grade; codes ending -HE3 are RoHS and AEC-Q101 qualified. 1N4448W-E3-08 is the commercial part on a 7-inch reel of 3000.",
